<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct palladium imports down 26.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct palladium imports down 26.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's palladium imports in October were down by 26.9 percent from a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry data released on Thursday.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in kg):</p>
<p>		    Oct 96	 Sept 96    Oct 95</p>
<p> Total	    7,175	  4,150	 9,813</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	   5,189	  2,736	 5,824</p>
<p> South Africa     885	    481	 1,248</p>
<p>Imports in the first 10 months of 1996 were 66.26 tonnes, against 85.01 tonnes in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
